n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __prev fancy-main-prev\" style=\"border-right: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __next fancy-main-next\" style=\"border-left: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_05.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_03.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_04.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_01.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_02.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深圳證券交易所周日發聲明，就創業板做市商制度的詳細實施細則公開徵求意見，以增強市場穩定性及韌性，並提升整體運作質素。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">同時，上海證券交易所及深圳證券交易所周日推出新一輪減費措施，包括豁免交易單元使用費。此外，今年較早時實施的現有費用豁免，包括上市費用及債券交易手續費等，已額外延長兩年，直至2028年。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中國證券登記結算有限責任公司亦於周日發聲明指，將由2027年1月1日起至2028年12月31日，繼續豁免綠色公司債券、科技創新公司債券及民營企業公司債券（不包括可轉換債券）的發行人服務費及債券結算費。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">（CGTN）</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_05.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_05.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_03.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_03.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_04.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_04.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_01.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_01.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_02.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509614_02.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n</div>",
